    "text_full": "Cookie Settings\nMain Content\nMain Menu\nSEARCH\nMENU\nPeople\nPractices\nInsights\nFirm\nOur Firm\nOur Firm\n\nWith more than 260 attorneys and public policy advisors, Wiley has earned international esteem by representing clients, and igniting legal, regulatory, and policy ripples for many of the world's leading companies, organizations, and startups.\n\nON THIS PAGE:\nOverview\nWired Into Washington\nAt Our Core\nContact Us\n\nOUR POINT OF VIEW\n\nBrand position.\n\nWhat follows are the key ideas and themes that define our brand and our position. They guide our decisions, our partnerships, and how we set out to create transformational change with our clients.\n\nView our brand video\n\nWe are unified by a single location, squarely located in the heart of the most complex city in the world. Challenges here cross agencies, disciplines, and industries. So do we.\n\nMore than just possessors of knowledge, we are a nexus. We know how to move levers here across all the branches of government. We’re respected on both sides of the aisle and have nuanced insights into the mindsets of agencies, regulators, and lawmakers.\n\nOur single location allows us to connect disciplines seamlessly and adapt quickly to meet challenges that extend far beyond law. We see problems from multiple perspectives and can take very different approaches to solving them. In the era of uncertainty, our unwavering position here helps our clients see what’s coming next.\n\nWired into Washington.\n\nOur location may be focused, but our impact is felt everywhere. It reverberates in headlines and is quoted in precedents.\n\nOur clients spend a great deal of their time in uncharted territory, and we help them navigate it. A new world is forming, and we are shaping legal and regulatory landscapes for transformative markets and game-changing technologies that are writing the rules for what’s next.\n\nOur work creates legal and policy ripples wherever we go, which is why we are often seen as the go-to firm. We are often called in when everything is at stake, and being independent means we can assemble the right team under one roof to solve a client challenge, no matter how far it reaches.\n\nFelt around the world.\nOUR BRAND\nForge the path\nINCLUSION\nThe power of perspectives.\nPRO BONO\nGiving\nback.\nCAREERS\nLooking to make an impact?\n\nWHAT'S MOST IMPORTANT\n\nCore pillars.\n\nOur firm's authority – and how we approach it – can be distilled down to six core pillars. They inform how we work, how we're seen, and how we cultivate such an exceptional roster of world-changing clients.\n\nA culture of collegiality.\nRise together.\n\nThe level of trust and collegiality here is lights-out, and our culture is what powers it. We believe that when one of us advances, we all do. Everyone here could go anywhere they want, but we stay because we like practicing together and we are energized by what we accomplish.\n\nA focused mindset.\nWe don't attempt to be all things to all people.\n\nOur focus has allowed us to become a household name while defining the legal frameworks\nfor emerging markets and never-before-seen technologies. In an industry often measured\nby head-counts and global offices, we remain squarely at the forefront of impact.\n\nA mastery of DC.\nThis is where we thrive.\n\nWe know how to get things done in this city. Respected on both sides of the aisle, we know what committees are being formed, what investigations are underway, and most importantly, in the era of uncertainty, our well-established position here helps us see what’s coming next.\n\nA single office.\nA structurally different approach.\n\nOur single-office model unites us in ways highly beneficial to our clients and our culture. Everybody—from leadership to our newest associates—interacts under one roof. Being together creates connections across disciplines that help us deliver value and opportunity for our clients.\n\nForward-facing.\nWe're thinking ahead.\n\nWe are the secret firm in DC for several of the most bleeding-edge organizations in the world. From autonomous vehicles to blockchain technologies, our focused industry knowledge helps us anticipate challenges, craft policies, and create solutions for technologies that are still unfolding.\n\nTrue interdisciplinary depth.\nWe are a nexus.\n\nWe know an exceptional amount about the industries in which we focus. But we also understand how industry challenges today cross disciplines and touch multiple areas of law. Our experience and agility mean we can nimbly assemble the right team under one roof each and every time.\n\nYEAR IN REVIEW\nWired into Washington\nDownload the PDF\nMASTERY OF D.C.\nU.S. Government Experience: Firm Directory\nDownload PDF\n\nCONTACT US\n\nLet's talk.\n\nWhether creating new government strategies for our clients or integrating a full-service legal, regulatory, and communications campaign, we're doing the things that not only see change, but help our clients remain far ahead of it.\n\nContact\n\nPeople\nPractices\nInsights\nFirm\nCareers\nInclusion and Engagement\nHome\nSite Map\nTerms & Conditions\nPrivacy Policy\nCookies Policy & Settings\nCalifornia Privacy Notice\n© 2026 Wiley Rein LLP All Rights Reserved.\nSubscribe\n\nOur Site uses cookies to improve your experience. Cookies may collect your personal information, such as IP address or device identifier, which we may disclose to our analytics partners. You may opt out of the cookies that are not strictly necessary if you wish. By using this site, you agree to our updated Privacy Policy, Terms & Conditions, and Cookies Policy.\n\nCUSTOMIZE COOKIE CHOICES\nREJECT ALL COOKIES\nACCEPT ALL COOKIES"
